# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of it.
#
# .env is the important line. It holds live API keys, it is gitignored, and it must
# never reach the image. Keys are supplied at run time as environment variables.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist

# Local runtime state. The container starts from the seed and persists into its own
# volume; copying a developer's exercise state into the image would be confusing.
server/state.json
logs
tmp
*.log

# Not part of the product: the client deck, its renders and its toolchain.
slide-canvas

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Documentation that does not need to be in the build context
*.md
!README.md
